Description: grow bonsai trees in your terminal
 cbonsai is an advanced bonsai tree generator for the terminal, with
 seasonal color changes, procedural leaf generation, and support for
 persistent real-time growth. Trees automatically adapt their colors
 based on the current season and can be configured to grow live, over
 a fixed time, or over days and weeks between runs.
 .
 This implementation began as a fork of John Allbritten's cbonsai and
 has since diverged with a rewritten growth engine, procedural
 foliage, structural trunks, and seasonal color palettes.
